# Khor Beauty Backend Technical Documentation

## Backend API Server Architecture Documentation

---

# 1. Backend Project Overview

The Khor Beauty Backend system is responsible for the core business logic of the entire website and admin management system.

The backend is mainly responsible for:

* Appointment booking management
* Customer enquiries management
* Services management
* Admin authentication
* CRM customer data processing
* Frontend and backend API communication
* Payment integration
* WhatsApp automation
* Email notification system
* Dashboard analytics

The backend acts as the:

```txt
Central Business Logic System
```

Connected structure:

```txt
Frontend Website
↓
Admin Dashboard
↓
Backend API Server
↓
Database
```

---

