The backend uses:

| Technology | Purpose                         |
| ---------- | ------------------------------- |
| Node.js    | JavaScript Runtime              |
| Express.js | Backend Framework               |
| TypeScript | Type System                     |
| Prisma ORM | Database ORM                    |
